() Tj T*
(_Motive_ I. Consider how deeply nature itself doth engage you to) Tj T*
(the greatest care and diligence for the holy education of your) Tj T*
(children. They are, as it were, parts of yourselves, and those that) Tj T*
(nature teacheth you to love and provide for, and take most care for,) Tj T*
