(CHAPTER IX.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(THE SPECIAL DUTIES OF WIVES TO HUSBANDS.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(THE wife that expecteth comfort in a husband, must make conscience of) Tj T*
(all her own duty to her husband: for though it be his duty to be kind) Tj T*
(and faithful to her, though she prove unkind and froward, yet, 1. Men) Tj T*
(are frail, and apt to fail in such difficult duties as well as women.) Tj T*
