() Tj T*
(_Direct._ I. Understand and lament the corrupted and miserable) Tj T*
(state of your children, which they have derived from you, and) Tj T*
(thankfully accept the offers of a Saviour for yourselves and them, and) Tj T*
(absolutely resign, and dedicate them to God in Christ in the sacred) Tj T*
(covenant, and solemnize this dedication and covenant by their) Tj T*
(baptism.[27] And to this end understand the command of God for) Tj T*
(entering your children solemnly into covenant with him, and the) Tj T*
(covenant mercies belonging to them thereupon. Rom. v. 12, 16-18; Eph.) Tj T*
(ii. 1, 3; Gen. xvii. 4, 13, 14; Deut. xxix. 10-12; Rom. xi. 17, 20;) Tj T*
(John iii. 3, 5; Matt. xix. 13, 14.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
