(necessary to preserve their health. It would move one's heart with) Tj T*
(pity, to see how the houses of some of the higher sort are like) Tj T*
(hospitals; and education hath made, especially, the females like the) Tj T*
(lame, or sick, or bedrid; so that one part of the day that should be) Tj T*
