(force your tongues at first to speak of that which is good, the words) Tj T*
(which you speak or hear, may help to bring you into a better frame.) Tj T*
(Many a man hath begun to pray with coldness, that hath got him heat) Tj T*
(before he had done; and many a man hath gone unwillingly to hear a) Tj T*
(sermon, that hath come home a converted soul. 5. And when you set) Tj T*
(yourselves in the way of duty, you are in the way of promised grace.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
