(titles of information, reproof, exhortation, &c. And yet when the) Tj T*
(subject shall direct us to some other method, the hearers must not be) Tj T*
(offended with us: for one method will not serve exactly for every) Tj T*
(subject, and we must be loth to wrong the text or matter.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_Direct._ VI. It is a great help to memory, often in the time of) Tj T*
