(_Direct._ III. Remember that this God is instructing you, and) Tj T*
(warning you, and treating with you, about no less than the saving of) Tj T*
(your souls. Come therefore to hear as for your salvation. Can that) Tj T*
(heart be dull that well considereth, that it is heaven and hell that) Tj T*
(is the matter that God is treating with him about?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
