(doth infer a change in God by mere relation or extrinsical) Tj T*
(denomination; he being one that is, according to the tenor of his own) Tj T*
(established law and covenant, engaged to disown or punish the) Tj T*
(unbelieving, prayerless, and disobedient, and after engaged to own or) Tj T*
