(premeditated form of words?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_Answ._ No christian of competent understanding doubteth of it.) Tj T*
(We must premeditate on our wants, and sins, and the graces and mercies) Tj T*
(we desire, and the God we speak to; and we must be able to express) Tj T*
(these things without any loathsome and unfit expressions. But whether) Tj T*
(the words are fore-contrived or not, is a thing that God hath no more) Tj T*
