(not, yet you will venture your prayers at uncertainty, it being but so) Tj T*
(much labour lost; this I take to be sinfully superstitious, but not) Tj T*
(idolatry.[64] \(4.\) But to pray to living saints or sinners, for that) Tj T*
(which belongeth to them to give, is no sin at all.) Tj T*
