(_Quest._ XVIII. But what if the master of a family \(or pastor\) be) Tj T*
(a heretic or ungodly?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_Answ._ You must distinguish between his personal faults, and the) Tj T*
(faults of his performance or worship. His personal faults \(such as) Tj T*
(swearing or drunkenness, &c.\) you must disown, and must not choose a) Tj T*
(master \(or pastor\) that is such, while you have your choice, and may) Tj T*
