(a resurrection. What delightful work is it for your thoughts, to look) Tj T*
(back to your childhood, and remember how mercy brought you up, and) Tj T*
(conducted you to every place that you have lived in; and provided for) Tj T*
(you, and preserved you, and heard your prayers, and disposed of all) Tj T*
(things for your good; how it brought you under the means of grace, and) Tj T*
