(attendance; and of your delicious meats and drinks; and of all your) Tj T*
(mirth, and play, and recreations. Thus must your carcasses be forsaken) Tj T*
(of your souls, and laid in a grave, and there lie rotting in the dark;) Tj T*
(and your souls appear before your Judge, to be sentenced to their) Tj T*
(endless state. This certainly will be your case: and oh how quickly) Tj T*
(will it come! Then, what will Christ and grace be worth! Then, nothing) Tj T*
