(there may be as deep a regard and sorrow in some that have no tears,) Tj T*
(as in others that abound with them. But I speak of a naughty, selfish) Tj T*
(nature, that is little affected with any one's concernments but its) Tj T*
(own.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
